{
  "id": "preview-post",
  "namespace": "global",
  "version": 1,
  "title_de": "Post-Vorschau",
  "description": "Built-in (calm): realistic X, LinkedIn, Instagram and Facebook previews of one post draft, one platform at a time. Tabs with approval ticks, one large preview with the platform's own fold label, counters, one reason line and copy icons. Per platform mode: auto (the bot posts after Approve & post; a platform over its limit is blocked) or manual (the reviewer posts by hand: copies first, including the image, then Posted; never blocked). Request changes with a comment is the footer alternative.",
